iver"}],"gloss":"of the forest river","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இகுகரை","parts":[{"text":"இகு","lemma":"iku","gloss":"sloping/descending"},{"text":"கரை","lemma":"karai","gloss":"bank"}],"gloss":"sloping bank"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒலிநெடும்","parts":[{"text":"ஒலி","lemma":"oli","gloss":"dense/abundant"},{"text":"நெடும்","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"long"}],"gloss":"dense and long"},{"surface":"பீலி","parts":[{"text":"பீலி","lemma":"pīli","gloss":"peacock feather"}],"gloss":"peacock feathers"},{"surface":"துயில்வர","parts":[{"text":"துயில்","lemma":"tuyil","gloss":"sleep/rest"},{"text":"வர","lemma":"vara","gloss":"to come/to sweep"}],"gloss":"to sweep gently"},{"surface":"இயலி","parts":[{"text":"இயலி","lemma":"iyal","gloss":"moving gracefully"}],"gloss":"moving gracefully"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆடுமயில்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"āṭu","gloss":"dancing"},{"text":"மயில்","lemma":"mayil","gloss":"peacock"}],"gloss":"dancing peacock"},{"surface":"அகவும்","parts":[{"text":"அகவும்","lemma":"akavu","gloss":"calls/cries"}],"gloss":"which calls out"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"nāṭaṉ","gloss":"lord of the land"}],"gloss":"the lord of the land"},{"surface":"நம்மொடு","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"us"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with us"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நயந்தனன்","parts":[{"text":"நயந்தனன்","lemma":"naya","gloss":"he desired/loved"}],"gloss":"he desired"},{"surface":"கொண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கொண்ட","lemma":"koḷ","gloss":"having taken/established"}],"gloss":"established"},{"surface":"கேண்மை","parts":[{"text":"கேண்மை","lemma":"kēṇmai","gloss":"friendship/love"}],"gloss":"friendship/love"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பயந்தக்காலும்","parts":[{"text":"பயந்த","lemma":"payan","gloss":"yielded/produced"},{"text":"காலும்","lemma":"kāl-um","gloss":"even when"}],"gloss":"even when it yields pain"},{"surface":"பயப்பொல்லாதே","parts":[{"text":"பயப்பொல்லாதே","lemma":"பயப்பொல்லாதே","gloss":"is not bad in its outcome"}],"gloss":"is not bad in its outcome","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Loud rain abounding forest river's sloping bank / dense long peacock feathers sweeping gently, moving gracefully / dancing peacock calls out, the lord of such land, with us / desired and established friendship / even when it yields pain, its outcome is not bad.","translation":"The friendship established with us by the lord of the land—where dancing peacocks move gracefully, sweeping their dense, long feathers along the sloping banks of the forest river swollen by loud rains, and call out—is never bad in its outcome, even if it yields pain.","modern":"ஒலிக்கும் மழையினால் பெருகிய காட்டு ஆற்றின் சரிவான கரையில், அடர்ந்த நீண்ட தோகைகள் தரையைத் தொட்டு அசைந்து செல்ல, ஆடுகின்ற மயில்கள் கூவுகின்ற நாட்டின் தலைவன் நம்மோடு விரும்பிச் செய்த நட்பு, துன்பத்தைத் தந்தாலும் அதன் பயன் தீமையானது அன்று.","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine, talking to her confidante. Her lover, the lord of the mountain land, has delayed their marriage, causing her deep sorrow. Despite the pain of separation, she defends their love. She describes his land where peacocks dance on the sloping banks of a forest river swollen by heavy rains, sweeping their long feathers and calling out. This image of the peacock dancing despite the heavy rain reflects her own state: she remains devoted and finds beauty in their love despite the heavy sorrow of separation. She asserts that the love they share is noble and can never be considered bad or harmful, even if it currently brings her suffering.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}